<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar" source-id="s-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p001:m0000" ref="dwr_is1_jaf">簡之</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p001:m0003" ref="7e3_6f5_aqx">謙之</persName>，好學，撰晉紀二十卷，義熙末，為始興相。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-liuqianzhi-scholar:p002:m0000" ref="7e3_6f5_aqx">謙之</persName>破走之，進平廣州，誅其黨與，仍行州事。即以為振威將軍、廣州刺史。後為太中大夫。</p>
</text>
